{"parse": {"title": "Time Traveller's Shard", "pageid": 3528, "revid": 22464, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 371px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ed/Time_Traveller%27s_Shard.png/revision/latest?cb=20230529113343\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Time Traveller Shard.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ed/Time_Traveller%27s_Shard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/371?cb=20230529113343\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"371\" height=\"209\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Time Traveller&#39;s Shard.png\" data-image-key=\"Time_Traveller%27s_Shard.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Time_Traveller%27s_Shard.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Time Traveller Shard.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Time Traveler Shard</span> is a <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Secret Limited</span> item that was added in the <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">13.5 Update</a>.  It is received by completing tier 5 or above <a href=\"/wiki/Portals\" title=\"Portals\">Witch Portals</a> with a small drop chance. It is used to create the <a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Portal\" title=\"Secret Portal\">Secret Portal</a>, Witch City (Walpurges), which guarantees the host <span class=\"new\" title=\"Homuru (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG9tdXJ1P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Homuru</span>. You need 4 shards to create the secret portal. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Remember to make sure when crafting the portal that you don't have all portal slots full. The portal has a chance of being lost if all slots are full. Make sure you have 199/200 portals or fewer.</li>\n<li>The drop chance is <b>estimated</b> to be around 3%. Up until the summer update, the drop rate of Time Traveler Shard was increased by 50%,from 3% to 4.5%.</li>\n<li>It is <b>believed</b> to be that drop chance does not scale with the difficulty of the portal.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021160954\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 306/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 45/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.811      1 -total\n 96.08%    1.740      2 Template:RarityColor\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:3528-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261021160954 and revision id 22464. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Time_Traveller's_Shard.png"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Trivia", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Time_Traveller's_Shard", "byteoffset": 506, "anchor": "Trivia", "linkAnchor": "Trivia"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Time Traveller&#039;s Shard</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=22464&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:56:27.375688+00:00", "sha256": "39d3d95f780ac885fa11ec0455bf706e95090a590576a77aadf267174f63d1a2"}}